WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:08.172
Ding! Ding! Ding! A woman stood at the front desk of Mountain View Hotel.

2
00:00:08.173 --> 00:00:11.095
She was ringing the bell again and again.

3
00:00:11.096 --> 00:00:12.994
A man hurried out.

4
00:00:12.995 --> 00:00:15.240
"I'm Mr. Denton, the owner of this hotel.

5
00:00:15.241 --> 00:00:17.616
What's the matter, Mrs. Lopez?"

6
00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:20.488
"It's my wedding ring," she said.

7
00:00:20.489 --> 00:00:22.652
"I went for a run this morning.

8
00:00:22.653 --> 00:00:26.301
When I returned to my room, it was very dusty.

9
00:00:26.302 --> 00:00:28.918
And my ring was missing!"

10
00:00:28.919 --> 00:00:32.330
Mr. Denton frowned. "I'm sorry to hear that.

11
00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:33.664
But please don't worry.

12
00:00:33.665 --> 00:00:36.050
We'll search your room and find your ring."

13
00:00:36.051 --> 00:00:39.045
Just then a young couple approached the desk.

14
00:00:39.046 --> 00:00:42.245
"My laptop is gone!" the woman said.

15
00:00:42.246 --> 00:00:45.646
"My Fit-Think is missing too," her husband said.

16
00:00:45.647 --> 00:00:48.003
"There's a thief in this hotel!"

17
00:00:48.004 --> 00:00:51.068
Swoosh! Everyone looked up.

18
00:00:51.069 --> 00:00:54.144
Dust was pouring out of vents in the ceiling.

19
00:00:54.145 --> 00:00:56.951
It quickly covered everything in the lobby.

20
00:00:56.952 --> 00:01:00.064
"What's happening?" the young woman asked.

21
00:01:00.065 --> 00:01:02.797
"Ah-choo!" Mr. Denton sneezed.

22
00:01:02.798 --> 00:01:06.420
"I'm not sure. But, everyone, please follow me to the exit."

23
00:01:06.421 --> 00:01:10.289
"What about my laptop?" the young woman asked.

24
00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:12.281
More guests came into the lobby.

25
00:01:12.282 --> 00:01:16.003
They were all complaining about the dust and missing valuables.

26
00:01:16.004 --> 00:01:18.682
Mr. Denton tried to calm everyone down.

27
00:01:18.683 --> 00:01:21.642
"My staff and I will find your valuables, I promise.

28
00:01:21.643 --> 00:01:25.363
But right now we all need to exit the hotel safely." He

29
00:01:25.364 --> 00:01:27.971
sneezed again. "Ah-choo!" Then

30
00:01:27.972 --> 00:01:37.945
he covered his nose and mouth and led everyone outside. ***

31
00:01:37.946 --> 00:01:40.733
Roxy, Terrell, and Mara arrived at Jack's house.

32
00:01:40.734 --> 00:01:45.487
They were going to fly kites in the park.

33
00:01:45.488 --> 00:01:50.864
Jack let them in.

34
00:01:50.865 --> 00:01:54.065
"Where's your kite, Jack?" Terrell asked.

35
00:01:54.066 --> 00:01:57.118
Jack shrugged. "I know it's in my closet.

36
00:01:57.119 --> 00:02:00.563
I just can't find it."

37
00:02:00.564 --> 00:02:03.814
"We'll help you look," Roxy said.

38
00:02:03.815 --> 00:02:06.980
In Jack's bedroom he opened the closet door.

39
00:02:06.981 --> 00:02:11.425
"Whoa!" Terrell said. "That's a big mess!"

40
00:02:11.426 --> 00:02:16.320
Roxy laughed. "I'm not surprised you can't find your kite."

41
00:02:16.321 --> 00:02:23.459
Mara sighed. "It could take us hours to sort through this mess.

42
00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:26.787
I'll share my kite with you, Jack."

43
00:02:26.788 --> 00:02:31.278
Terrell shrugged. "It won't take that long. We'll find it.

44
00:02:31.279 --> 00:02:34.251
We can even organize your stuff, Jack."

45
00:02:34.252 --> 00:02:36.766
Roxy's watch suddenly beeped.

46
00:02:36.767 --> 00:02:41.559
"Oh, um, I have another kite at home. I'll go get it."

47
00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:46.852
Roxy rushed outside.

48
00:02:46.853 --> 00:02:48.953
"What's wrong, Mayor Bloom?"

49
00:02:48.954 --> 00:02:53.098
"A dust storm swept through Mountain View Hotel," he said.

50
00:02:53.099 --> 00:02:58.505
"What? A dust storm?" Roxy said. "That's strange."

51
00:02:58.506 --> 00:03:01.992
"Yes, and now there's dust everywhere inside the hotel.

52
00:03:01.993 --> 00:03:03.879
But that's not all, Rocket Girl.

53
00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:06.676
Some of the guests are missing valuables."

54
00:03:06.677 --> 00:03:09.265
"Hmm," Roxy said.

55
00:03:09.266 --> 00:03:15.915
"Sounds like I need to bust the dust—and find a thief!"

